# Card Crafters reverse proxy (Caddy 2).
#
# Requirements for automatic HTTPS:
#   - DNS A record pointing CC_DOMAIN at this server's public IP
#   - inbound ports 80 and 443 open (80 for the ACME HTTP-01 challenge)
#   - CC_DOMAIN set in .env (read by docker-compose.prod.yml)
#
# WebSockets are proxied by default — Socket.IO needs no extra config.
#
# LAN mode: leave CC_DOMAIN empty. Caddy's automatic HTTPS needs a real
# public domain, so for LAN play just skip this service entirely and use
# the app's published port (http://<host>:3000) instead.

{$CC_DOMAIN} {
	reverse_proxy app:3000
}
